{"parse": {"title": "间隔月-06", "pageid": 101219, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-05\" title=\"间隔月-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">间隔月-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-07\" title=\"间隔月-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">间隔月</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.B1.E9.87.8D.E7.9A.84.E8.8D.92.E9.87.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"失重的荒野\">失重的荒野</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 失重的荒野</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Weightless Wasteland</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一次完美的休假应该由什么组成呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娱乐项目？取决于休假人具体的爱好。远离熟悉的居所？这并非所有人的渴望。当地特色美食？噢，这个越多越好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>请再给我一个覆盆子奶冻，还要一份酥皮南瓜鸡肉浓汤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>真高兴你的胃口还是这么好，亲爱的西尔维。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>总部的食物供应还是保持着相当高的水准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>可惜总有研究员不懂得享受食物的美好，甚至想要发明能让人避免进食的浓缩营养片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>听起来很方便，他们最好记得让那玩意儿尝起来不坏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我还是免了，我更喜欢亲自进餐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>说真的我还想再要个甜品，你还想来点什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我就不用了。请尽情享用你的下午茶，说好了我请你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>呼！多么充实的假期啊，除了美食就是研究，我现在感觉好极了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>所以你真的……是来度假的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>有什么问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>可你……算了，我会努力习惯的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你昨晚提出的那个实验设计简直是天才的想法，你果然是最适合的人。你的加入一定会提高我那次休假旅行的含金量！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>那么，你考虑得怎么样了，亲爱的西尔维？看在随便什么，哪怕是总部的厨师的面子上，你会留下的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>郑重而饱含感情的邀请让冷周六的思绪从专注咀嚼中回归。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你的项目棒极了，真的。你知道我不太会恭维别人，这段时间的实验帮我理顺了思路……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以赞扬作为铺垫，然后逐渐放缓语气，所有人都知道后面会接着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你要说但是了吗？噢不，亲爱的，你带给我的心碎已经够多了，拉普拉斯要怎么盛放得下呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是徒劳的抗争。绿棱镜清楚地知道。她还没能阻止过对方宣布任何自己不想接受的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>别这么孩子气，就算你捂着耳朵我也知道你能听到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我很感谢你的邀请，也很看好你的项目前景，但这和我想要追求的方向并不一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我不接受……我不明白！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>呼……你总是说你不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>幸好我不是真的需要任何意见或建议，只是告知你我的决定，你不明白也没什么关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我知道我不该质疑任何人的研究理想，但就算你往太空发射了一张唱片，一艘飞船，甚至一个活人……这又有什么意义呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>亲爱的，星星离我们实在太远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>远到你那可怜的瞳孔还没来得及捕捉它诞生时的光辉，它的形骸就已经崩毁在时间之前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>等等，用诗歌的语言探讨学术问题可不够严谨。“时间之前”？这得看你如何定义时间——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二人不约而同地停下即将渐入佳境的争执，两个老朋友四目相对，同时被那种似曾相识的感受攫住。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>如果我们的相处有什么问题的话，您明明可以早点告诉我啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>相处？不，我们的相处当然没有问题。一切都很愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我只是对普列谢茨克那个项目更感兴趣。神秘学和科学的结合，航空航天领域的前沿应用，每一条都正中我的理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>那是相当边缘的项目，说不定根本没有多少研究人员，也申请不下什么经费——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>亲爱的西尔维，你得知道，这个项目被拉普拉斯冷遇肯定是有原因的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我们的蛇纹石棉石相关论文马上就会发表，立刻就会被投入前沿应用！你的天赋决定了你能在这条路上走得很远——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>可那对我又有什么意义呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>就算蛇发女妖天生擅长生产石棉，也不代表我非得在这一领域奉献终生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>虽然在空间材料学上取得的成就也让我觉得高兴，但这并非我所向往的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>向往的事和擅长的事不能重合，这在概率学上并不少见，我很清楚该如何抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你明知道你所追寻的太空只是一片贫瘠失重的荒野，亲爱的。几乎没人能在那里生存，支撑人类一切探索行为的仅仅是好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我不认为你应该在这上面浪费你的才华和天赋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好奇还不够吗？如果在演化中这种本能被如此完整而强烈地保留了下来，那它一定有其存在的重要意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>如我们所知，每个人都会迎来自己的终结。我只是想在迎来终结之前践行我自己的意义，而不是被困在“擅长”里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>考虑到你的年龄，这听起来有点像是逆反情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>考虑到你的语气，这听起来有点像是人身攻击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我很抱歉，西尔维……如果冒犯到了你，那并非是我的本意。我只是，只是没有办法理解——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>亲爱的，星星离我们实在太远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>在古老的诗歌里，引导你入职的我应该肩负起导师的责任。我坚持你的研究才华不应该浪掷在死去的星光上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我也有我的坚持。如果你非要一个解释的话——尽可以当做是食尘之蛇无端渴慕着天空，还有天空之上的更高处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>旅行者一号到底去了哪里，金唱片的归处在哪里，离开地球之后我们可以去往哪里——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>所有的这些“哪里”对我都有意义。那片贫瘠失重的荒野，还有荒野里的每一颗星星，对我都有意义。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我不需要旁人认同这份意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，她们从对方的眼睛里看见了彼此共同的回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜&amp;冷周六：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默之后的微笑意味深长，除了被情景重现触动，也饱含确认对方没有改变的无奈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>时间显然没能改变争执双方的任何观点，意识到这一点后，就连后续的争执也不再有必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……所以直到现在，你还是觉得，我不该在“死去的星光”上“浪掷我的研究才华”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你当年可没能完全说服我，亲爱的。如果不是因为你眼中的理想光辉太耀眼，我可能会再坚持一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>理想光辉？我不确定那是什么，但谢谢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>作为对理想的尊重，我只能恶狠狠地告诉你，如果后悔了，我会为你保留一张办公桌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不瞒你说，被通知传送软盘项目将会被终止的时候，我还想起了这回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>那时候我可真没想到，你会在普列谢茨克做出一番真正的大事业。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>即便是在那之后的现在，你仍然认为我需要回归“研究的正途”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我承认我在这方面是个古板的人，亲爱的。就像我以为荣光会让你在餍足之余回过头，重新看看星光以外的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，那真遗憾。宇宙很大，星星很多，我还要看很久很久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>天啊，看看——就是这个，耀眼的理想光辉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>好吧，显然，我又只能面对被求职简历淹没的苦痛命运了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你看，无论哪个版本的故事，梅露西娜总会重蹈普列西娜的覆辙……或许蛇发女妖的血统中流传下来的不只是石棉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>传说中的吕西尼昂是一夜建起的城市，梅露西娜却不是建筑大师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>这些年我听从你们的建议，也尝试过从“梅露西娜中心主义”来考虑问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>请允许我插入你们的话题，我迫不及待想要听一听“梅露西娜中心主义”的文学评论！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>当然可以，亲爱的艾斯黛乐，还有你，我亲爱的、冷酷的小黄瓜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>请允许我从梅露西娜的视角解读她的传说——言出必践的奇迹才是那个故事的真正内核。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>衷心地祝你好运，我最亲爱的西尔维。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>谢谢，也祝你好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>不过这次我恐怕不能许诺为你保留一张办公桌了。毕竟我们的新项目相当热门，我的办公桌都快要被入职申请堆满了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我得说，你真的炫耀到我了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_siweidiantang\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_siweidiantang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>按照约定，在假期即将结束的时候，迪布瓦们再次召开了聚会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>说真的二号，我对追寻星空和科学前沿一点意见都没有，但非得在普列谢茨克吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>我还是太遗憾了，你们都不知道我有多么喜欢西蒙娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅵ：</div><div>新的研究计划书说服了我，我们应该能要到让人满意的预算……吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我赞同马克西姆的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未曾设想的开场白让小蛇们略微安静了一会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅲ：</div><div>嘶嘶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>你吓得三号差点开口说人话。我的话总是很有道理，你赞同哪句？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我要修改今天的讨论案。如果短期内不需要发射实践的话，我们确实可以先把办公室搬回总部。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "间隔月-06"}}